{"ancestors": "0,9018672", "bizKey": "9019534", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-10-12 16:42:39", "detail": "<p>题材相关新闻：</p><p>2023年9月</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;\">近日，工信部下发《关于推进</span><a href=\"iwin://cmd=openf5&amp;stockcode=882295.bak\" target=\"\" style=\"text-indent: 32px; text-align: justify;\">5G</a><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;\">轻量化（RedCap）技术演进和应用创新发展的通知（征求意见稿）》</span></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/10/12/13bf2921-cd00-4597-9407-fb3aedc5de74-1697100084585.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 382.99px;height: 217.03px;\"/></p><p><br></p><p>题材基本面介绍：</p><p>RedCap（Reduced Capability）是一种5G轻量化技术，它可以降低5G终端芯片和模组的高昂成本，降低设备复杂程度的同时具有最大带宽更窄、调制阶数更低、功耗更低等特点，被业界称为“精简版”5G，实现成本与性能的平衡。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/10/12/cb74ec9b-a626-49fe-81a8-4e1f0cb2ea51-1697100154150.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 386.98px;height: 294.24px;\"/></p>", "firstLetter": "REDCAP", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 2, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "RedCap", "parentId": 9018672, "pctChg": -1.84, "reason": "相关新闻：近日，工信部下发《关于推进5G轻量化（RedCap）技术演进和应用创新发展的通知（征求意见稿）》", "remark": "", "sort": 10, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9019534, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-10-12 16:42:39"}
